1. Configure paths
Edit config.py to set your data paths:

config.train_folder = '/path/to/your/train_set'
config.val_folder = '/path/to/your/val_set'

2. Train the model

# Train with default settings
python train.py

# Train with custom settings
python train.py --epochs 50 --batch_size 32 --learning_rate 0.001

3. Evaluate the model

# Evaluate multi-task model
python evaluate.py --mode multi_task --task both

# Evaluate single model (classification only)
python evaluate.py --mode single_model --task classification

4. Make predictions on single image

from inference import predict_image

result = predict_image(
    model_path='saved_models/best_model.pth',
    image_path='path/to/image.jpg'
)
print(result)

